やばい。もう見捨てない！もう見捨てない！やばい！おばけやだ！おばけやだ！わしおばけやです！
Oh no. I won't abandon you anymore! I won't abandon you anymore! Oh no! I hate ghosts! I hate ghosts! I hate ghosts, old man!

643
