お主もずっとそのままいてくれてありがとう。お主が一番わかりやすい。
Thank you for staying just like that. You're the easiest to understand, old man.

657
00:52:54,900 --> 00:52:59,080
髪も見た！髪はいた！
I saw the hair too! The hair was there!

658
00:53:02,240 --> 00:53:04,660
お主、お主届かないね。
Old man, you can't reach it.

659
00:53:06,580 --> 00:53:09,200
お主届かないね。異変全然なくて草。
You can't reach it. So funny that there are no anomalies at all.

660
