ここまで異変ないことある？
Is there ever no anomaly up to here?

661
00:53:14,720 --> 00:53:15,620
にゃーい！
Meow!

662
00:53:17,700 --> 00:53:18,740
にゃーい！
Meow!

663
00:53:21,880 --> 00:53:22,640
ないな。
None.

664
00:53:24,480 --> 00:53:25,640
おし！
Alright!

665
00:53:29,060 --> 00:53:30,660
おし、異変起きないな全然。
Alright, no anomalies happening at all.

666
00:53:36,640 --> 00:53:39,180
もう見捨てないぞお主ら！もう見捨てない！しっかりと見るよ。
I won't abandon you guys anymore! I won't abandon you! I'll look properly.

667
00:53:41,080 --> 00:53:42,300
はい、がんばってますね。
Yes, you're doing your best.

668
00:53:58,080 --> 00:53:59,880
異変です！明らかに！
It's an anomaly! Clearly!

669
00:54:01,080 --> 00:54:02,880
異変ってことは進む。
Anomaly means we move forward.

670
00:54:04,540 --> 00:54:06,440
手痛、手！手痛！
Hand hurts, hand! Hand hurts!

671
