覚えてきた。
I've memorized it.

673
00:54:30,900 --> 00:54:32,500
もう覚えてきた！
I've already memorized it!

674
00:54:32,500 --> 00:54:35,880
正直、あの最初の2回のミスは、覚えミス！
Honestly, those first two misses were memorization mistakes!

675
