694
00:56:06,201 --> 00:56:07,101
3って何？
What is car 3?

695
00:56:07,541 --> 00:56:08,161
3って何？
What is car 3?

696
00:56:10,831 --> 00:56:11,461
3って何？
What is car 3?

697
